00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.350
Leah: Lean project management focusses
on ‘value’ delivery in project

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:07.850
management terms from the customers
perspective by cutting down on

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:12.110
‘waste’ whilst optimising efficiency
therefore delivering more with less.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:17.809
Whereas traditional project management
is structured in stages, lean project

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:21.620
management enables teams to deliver
faster by managing workflow more

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:23.840
efficiently with continuous improvement.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.450
It means working to deliver
what the client needs rather

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:28.749
than just what they asked for.

00:00:29.469 --> 00:00:33.949
Jack: Lean project managers identify
objectives, requirements, deliverables

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.060
and acceptance criteria and the value is
what the client is willing to pay for.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:42.430
Anything not focussed on solving the
problem is seen as wasted resources.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:47.200
Cutting out wasted resources can have
a positive effect on delivery time and

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.030
therefore time spent on the project.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.550
It can also help to create
continuous workflow.

00:00:53.289 --> 00:00:56.210
Leah: A key instrument in
Lean Project Management is the

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.480
Plan-Do-Check-Act cycle [PDCA].

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:04.729
This is a four-stage method that
includes solutions testing, analysing

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.540
results, and improving the process
to enable teams to avoid recurring

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.780
mistakes and improve operations.

00:01:11.299 --> 00:01:14.190
It is a good way of establishing
a culture of solutions testing

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:18.360
on a smaller scale which in turn
minimises potential for reworking.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:23.770
The goal is to plan, execute and test
a potential solution and then analyse

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:25.770
the results from a client’s perspective.

